  dialogueId: serna_intro
  nodes:
  - nodeId: 1
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: 'Why can''t I ever feel full? Why am I always hungry? Why am I
      stuck like this!

'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 2
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 3
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: Hi Im Serna and Im tired of eating endlessly, can you help me break
      free from this curse?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 2fced5bfca0e145aabd7f791906e238c, type: 3}
    choices:
    - choiceText: Of course, Serna. I'd like to help you.
      inputLabel: Z
      nextNodeId: 4.1
      karmaChange: 50
      coinChange: 20
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 0
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    - choiceText: Curses aren't real! What are you 4?
      inputLabel: X
      nextNodeId: 4.2
      karmaChange: -20
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 1
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    - choiceText: Tell me more about this curse.
      inputLabel: C
      nextNodeId: 4.3
      karmaChange: 0
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 2
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    nextNodeId: 
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 4.1
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: You... you would? Thank you! I haven't felt kindness in so long.
      All I know about this curse is that a blessed food is what can set me free.
      The food needs to be blessed by a monk and until then, I have to keep eating
      all this food falling from the sky as a form of karma to repent for all my
      past deeds
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 17728860f61a448389561f2bde966935, type: 3}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 5.1
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 4.2
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: You, you wouldn't know a curse even if it was staring right at
      your face you ignorant child.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 25ac94fd8195e4a7095b8a8ec3b2d584, type: 3}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 5.2
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 4.3
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: 'Of course...All I know about this curse is that only a blessed
      food by a monk is what can set me free. '
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 17728860f61a448389561f2bde966935, type: 3}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 5.3
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 6
    speakerName: sammy
    dialogueText: What a coincidence! Monk Ananda just gave me a temple offering
      blessed by the monk himself!
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - choiceText: Share bread with Serna
      inputLabel: Z
      nextNodeId: 7.1
      karmaChange: 0
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 0
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    - choiceText: Don't offer the bread!
      inputLabel: X
      nextNodeId: 7.2
      karmaChange: 0
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 1
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    nextNodeId: neutral_response
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 5.2
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: Anyways, only a blessed monk food can set me free from eating all
      this food falling from the sky!
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: c4900afa99af04652a0acd745971d6d1, type: 3}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 6
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 5.3
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: Until then, I have to keep eating all this food falling from the
      sky.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 06e8c6269710b41148666381cda147a8, type: 3}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 6
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 5.1
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: You seem to be a kind person I can tell you have places to go!
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 6
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 2
    speakerName: sammy
    dialogueText: 'Hi there- Wow! that looks like alot of yummy treats! Watch out
      for that sugar!

'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 3
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 8.1
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: Wow! Are you for real! Is this truly happening? Am I going to be
      free after all this time! Free from all this food-eating misery!
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 04ad1376b575a4bc48c315edfb9e4c11, type: 3}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
    isEnd: 1
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 8.2
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: So-can I have some of the bread? Du-uh! Aren't you being the selfish
      one and they call me the hungry ghost here, wha-at!
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: -203655887218126122, guid: 25ac94fd8195e4a7095b8a8ec3b2d584, type: 3}
    choices:
    - choiceText: Share the bread
      inputLabel: Z
      nextNodeId: 9.1
      karmaChange: 0
      coinChange: 0
      requiredKarmaLevel: 0
      choiceStyle: 0
      conditions: []
      actions: []
    nextNodeId: end_sernaBread
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 9.2
    speakerName: Serna
    dialogueText: Wasn't that difficult now was it? Thanks!
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 
    isEnd: 1
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 7.1
    speakerName: 
    dialogueText: Here, would you like some blessed bread to set yourself free?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    nodeAnimation: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
    nextNodeId: 8.1
    isEnd: 0
    conditions: []
    onShowActions: []
  - nodeId: 7.2
    speakerName: sammy
    dialogueText: "Ha-ha It smelled soooo not-great\u2026definitely something funky
